items.source:
Enable Redis Pub/Sub listener annotated endpoints that are created under the cover by a
<a href="RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation"><code>RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a>. To be used on
<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html" title="class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation"><code>@Configuration</code></a> classes as follows:

<pre class="code">@Configuration
@EnableRedisListeners
public class AppConfig {

        @Bean
        public RedisMessageListenerContainer myRedisListenerContainer() {
                RedisMessageListenerContainer factory = new RedisMessageListenerContainer();
                factory.setConnectionFactory(connectionFactory());
                return factory;
        }

        // other @Bean definitions
}
</pre>

items.translation:
启用由 <a href="RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation"><code>RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a> 在后台创建的带有 Redis Pub/Sub 监听器注解的端点。该功能可用于如下所示的 <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html" title="class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation"><code>@Configuration</code></a> 类：

<pre class="code">@Configuration
@EnableRedisListeners
public class AppConfig {

        @Bean
        public RedisMessageListenerContainer myRedisListenerContainer() {
                RedisMessageListenerContainer factory = new RedisMessageListenerContainer();
                factory.setConnectionFactory(connectionFactory());
                return factory;
        }

        // 其他 @Bean 定义
}
</pre>
